# Determiners in the dative that make a this-phrase take its lead word: "an diesem Donnerstag".
# Before a calendar date the determiner folds with its lead word: "an diesem 31. Januar".
# Saved under knowledge/wiki/audits/chronologia/parity-fixes/marker-strand/sources/ in the workspace:
# DWDS, "an": "2. zeitlich a) ... Grammatik: mit Dativ. Beispiele: das Wetter an diesem" [de-an-dwds.txt]
# Duden, "an": "mit Dativ ... an diesem 31. Januar" [de-an-duden.txt]
diesem
